{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32172","headline":"和沈参军招友生观芙蓉池 · 温庭筠","name":"和沈参军招友生观芙蓉池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂栋坐清晓，瑶琴商凤丝。\n况闻楚泽香，适与秋风期。\n遂从櫂萍客，静啸烟草湄。\n倒影回澹荡，愁红媚涟漪。\n湘茎久鲜涩，宿雨增离披。\n而我江海意，楚游动梦思。\n北渚水云叶，南塘烟雾枝。\n岂亡台榭芳，独与鸥鸟知。\n珠坠鱼迸浅，影多凫泛迟。\n落英不可攀，返照昏澄陂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}